  ### the program, as written
  ```
  reachable(Source, Target) <- edge(Source, Target).
  reachable(Source, Target) <- reachable(Source, Mid),
                               edge(Mid, Target).
  ```

  [`v6/labs/exec_shootout/dl6/reachability.dl6:2`](vscode://file/Users/chrishafley/projects/sprefa-lanes/emitrace/v6/labs/exec_shootout/dl6/reachability.dl6:2)
